## What's happening?
Writing one payload into the destination buffer for `{{component_id.name}}` in pipeline `{{pipeline_name.name}}` took **{{value}} seconds** on average over the last 10 minutes, above the 0.1s warning threshold and well above the ~0.003s baseline.
